{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "41c3f79add93bb2ea52667eebf307d66cdb6c4011158b674a82e6e01e3d59b3e", "ja": "ミュージカルの稽古", "zh": "音乐剧练习", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4000_place", "source_sha256": "dd72519cad7dcdf11e8c3671c83d933529fc027871ab23a8e84e8c573e01baf2", "ja": "ダンスレッスンスタジオ", "zh": "舞蹈教室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "237b260faf7b52dca2e13aa770d6e7802d8e8396b95dc66a93aa2dbb1b22df50", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……まだまだっ！　\nもう一曲、行くよっ！", "zh": "呼、呼……还不行！\n要再练一首啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4002_p", "source_sha256": "b524b6e0b7016d6277d8efaf11aa613392ecfbaf0bd6d204adbfb9a689829d70", "ja": "おいおい、足元がふらついてるぞ、歩！\n毎日居残りで特訓なんて、やりすぎじゃないか？", "zh": "喂喂，你都站不稳了啊，步！\n每天都留下来练习，也练过头了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4518ee4c5a04d0eed1c8d1b2d721bb126a1e2eac7e519bd9f2c973803dd7d377", "ja": "このくらい、平気だって。まだ曲や振りつけに\n慣れてないし、少しでもたくさん練習したいんだよ。", "zh": "这点练习没什么啦，我都还没熟悉曲子和舞步，\n希望能尽量多加练习啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4004_p", "source_sha256": "ca77c031842e5276ab064660042c28d1a0e1256c64754104f85509877a34ef78", "ja": "気持ちはわかるけど……\nその調子じゃ、本番までもたないぞ？", "zh": "虽然可以理解你的心情……\n但这样下去，可撑不到正式演出喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e517aae3f391ac4c9228db5527f3bc459d59cd4b018e3d2147f88cc0e51dd68a", "ja": "う……じゃあ、もう一曲だけ！\nこれで絶対、ラストにするからさ。ダメ？", "zh": "呜……那再一首就好！\n这就是最后一首了啦，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4006_p", "source_sha256": "76e65b4e30270421d155f4cbaaf7135e797da98f4e258a2a7a7a0b04ca08d889", "ja": "……わかった。じゃあ……。", "zh": "……好吧，那……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4007", "source_sha256": "476d6c868bd18ea29a491740e3f4eda0a7b4d0e9ef3dd2074ddf6b8f1ff979d5", "ja": "トコトンつきあう", "zh": "奉陪到底", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4008", "source_sha256": "da0dadd032abd664331ee94ea2a2e1a59d2a58eb341e307d718170234909e6e9", "ja": "もう一曲だけだぞ", "zh": "最后一首了喔", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4009", "source_sha256": "9f01d5deb1b75fe2a6c8c154010c7ff3d9e6bd7e72bf6907d87f678c8f0b7dab", "ja": "少し休憩しよう", "zh": "稍微休息一下吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4100_p", "source_sha256": "43e64ad34373b1a061088e89ffb2e8a636b5fe26b04100cea3093d0985c3f0d9", "ja": "仕方ないな。こうなったら、最後までつきあうよ。\nただし、スタジオの使用時間内まで、だ。いいな？", "zh": "没办法，既然如此，就陪你到最后吧。\n但不能超过舞蹈教室的使用时间，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4101_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8574a7120a93539bfb3d6127ae2cef789fcefdaba2e059e2a01e0515b4e23357", "ja": "ホント！？　サンキュー、{$P$}！\nアタシのワガママ、聞いてくれてさ……。", "zh": "真的！？谢啦，{$P$}！\n谢谢你包容我的任性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4102_034ayu", "source_sha256": "29100a2335a609170e92780fa524e1b479702e3c0ba29acaf21fedc58d39e6c1", "ja": "この役、絶対にマスターしてみせるから、見てて！\nアイアム・ナンバー・ワーンっ！", "zh": "我一定会完美饰演这个角色，你看着吧！\nI am No.1！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4200_p", "source_sha256": "64e05b2ac1401a47a975e7d9a381214d27b04889a3e3e6e21ae6034693e2c8e8", "ja": "仕方がないな……もう一曲だけだからな？\nそれ以上は、体によくないからな。", "zh": "真没办法……这是最后一首了喔？\n再练下去对身体不好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4201_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a096707e7de8304698cfd4c55eb2ed99d7709b3b333a6c3e114a68681caa4f16", "ja": "へへっ。ありがと、{$P$}！\n大丈夫、ムリなんかしないって！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你，{$P$}！\n别担心，我不会逞强的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4202_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d0ea8fb1d8486ef2086cab508f9f7f42c04f848f4b74b3347d2939c766a2d602", "ja": "ラストワン……集中して、思いっきり、全力でいくよ！\n今のアタシの力、出しきってみせる！", "zh": "Last one……我要集中精神，使尽全力跳！\n我要用尽全身的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4300_p", "source_sha256": "461fe776c7b2d6677d9ffe01fcd8972a3405c6aa500b640be747455ebf818059", "ja": "その前に、少し休憩してからだな。\nそれがイヤなら、すぐに帰らせるぞ。", "zh": "在那之前先休息一下吧，\n如果不要的话，就马上赶你回家喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4301_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7e6946ff99d76bb44cf2c89ec3787c1d0bb05e6d3de5b717d9a76198972b0c92", "ja": "うぇえっ！？　ちぇ～、ノッてるうちに\nコツを掴んでおきたかったんだけどな～。", "zh": "咦！？啧～我还想趁状况好的时候\n抓住诀窍的说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_4302_034ayu", "source_sha256": "54218d3619ca0c152717a37aa6a78cdb7edc0d138dce6214ae1fb59e274133a6", "ja": "ま、しょーがないか。わかったよ。\nちょっと休憩しよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "好吧，没办法，我知道了，\n稍微休息一下吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
